msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1010
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An event in a group's calendar, once or repeating. The start and the end are those of the first occurrence, and repeats keep the local time of the event's time zone. A value can announce an event. Its place is words, and on a map the place of a group or a point, an area or a route of its own."
