msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1094
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An invitation to a group sent to an email address, and so to the account behind it, never to one of its profiles. The person picks which of their profiles accepts it, or makes a new one, and only then does the inviter learn which: an accepted group invitation naming it takes the place of this row. Until then the inviter sees the address they typed. The first profile, made in the window the invitation's link opens, goes straight into the group of the oldest one. It lapses after 30 days."
