#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The value has at most 16 KB."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1806
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What an app keeps for one person, nobody else reads, not even its editors."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:996
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What one app, or a site in its frame, keeps for one profile alone, such as how far its reader got: a key and a value. Nobody else reads it, not even the app's editors, and the person sees and deletes it in the settings. An app keeps up to 100 keys per profile, each value up to 16 KB. Deleting the app, its group or the account takes them along."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:503
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "name the app gives it"
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:504
