#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1937
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each <GroupMemberRole>role</GroupMemberRole> given or taken, by an admin, a decision of a <Poll>poll</Poll> or an approved request, each change of a <GroupRole>role</GroupRole> of the statute or of its permissions, a <GroupManifest>manifest</GroupManifest> made or dropped, each setting of a <Group>group</Group> that lets people in, who sees an <GroupAltDescription>alternative description</GroupAltDescription>, and each member admitted, removed, blocked or gone of their own accord, with the roles they held, is written as a <GroupAccessChange>change of access</GroupAccessChange>, in the same step as the change, with who did it. What follows from these by itself, such as members coming into an inheriting sub-group, is not written, nor are invitations. Every member of the group reads the changes, and a <GroupBlock>block</GroupBlock> only those who may remove members."
msgstr ""

